% SCAFFOLDING stand-in for SIMPOS's class `temporary_multi_column_menu`,
% compiled by psi/espc.py into the package `simpos`.  It is NOT SIMPOS:
% the class is lost (docs/simpos/subsystems/window.md §0.3, §1.6, the
% single-select menus).  TM-125 p8 (4.1) lists it as a stand-alone class:
% "the class for making the single select multi column temporary menu".
% MENDELS (IFS No.61), 2026-11-27: a slot of its graphic_select, made
% with two empty columns (graph_sel.esp:15-16).
%
% THE NATURE LIST IS INFERENCE: no composite's list is printed (window.md
% §1.6).  From TM-125 p8-12 (every menu inherits as_menu; as_multiple_
% column; as_single_select; a menu takes mouse input; temporary_window
% the base class, p6-7) and the held temporary menus' lists (MENDELS
% temporary_turn_menu, win_class.esp:27-35: labeled_sash,
% as_scrolling_menu, as_single_select, as_mouse_input, temporary_window).
% Only the menu's layout and the frame are stood in (as_menu.esp,
% basic_window.esp); its reading (read/2 with abort when the mouse leaves,
% as temporary_menu.esp's) is not, and a send to it is refused loudly.
% It has no method of its own.

class temporary_multi_column_menu has

nature
        labeled_sash,
        as_menu,
        as_multiple_column,
        as_single_select,
        as_mouse_input,
        temporary_window;

end.
